  "boundaries": [
    "Web entity order substitutes for FirstOfGroup; native exact group iteration and registration order not replay-verified.",
    "Only already sourced portions of Trig_UnitDeathActions run; its other unresolved branches remain unimplemented.",
    "A0HW is in the final elseif chain before bone-dragon decrement. Independent Lich/duel/economy/death callbacks are not disabled with this trigger.",
    "Range scans include kings and use a snapshot; hidden/Locust/removed bodies are omitted at enumeration. Exact native host filtering remains unverified.",
    "A20D SelectRange excludes dead and Avul; A0HW DamageAoe filters only enemy after enumeration, damage handles immunity/dead targets.",
    "Existing direct sourceDeath callbacks now execute the same alchemy entry draw as damage deaths, including dummy/timed-life events."
  ],
